# Querious — Complete UI Redesign Prompt

## Overview

You are a senior frontend engineer and product designer. Your task is to completely redesign the UI of this MERN Q&A application — now rebranded as **Querious**. Every screen must look like a modern, opinionated SaaS product — not a Stack Overflow clone. The current UI is a direct visual copy of Stack Overflow (orange top border, `#f8f9f9` background, blue links, tag pills, etc). Every trace of that visual identity must be removed and replaced with the design system defined below.

The logo file is located at the root of the project. Import it wherever the old Stack Overflow logo was used.

All text that currently reads "Stack Overflow", "stack overflow", "stackoverflow.com", or any variation must be replaced with **Querious**.

