## Design System

Define all CSS custom properties in a single `:root` block in `client/src/index.css`. Every component CSS file must use only these variables — no hardcoded hex values anywhere.

```css
:root {
  /* Brand */
  --color-brand-primary:    #6c63ff;   /* indigo-violet — main CTA, links */
  --color-brand-secondary:  #a78bfa;   /* soft purple — hover states, accents */
  --color-brand-gradient:   linear-gradient(135deg, #6c63ff 0%, #a78bfa 100%);

  /* Backgrounds */
  --color-bg-base:          #0f0f13;   /* near-black page background */
  --color-bg-surface:       #1a1a24;   /* card / sidebar background */
  --color-bg-elevated:      #22223a;   /* hover / selected state */
  --color-bg-input:         #16161f;   /* input fields */

  /* Borders */
  --color-border:           #2e2e45;   /* default border */
  --color-border-focus:     #6c63ff;   /* focused input border */

  /* Text */
  --color-text-primary:     #e8e8f0;   /* headings and body */
  --color-text-secondary:   #9898b0;   /* meta text, timestamps, vote counts */
  --color-text-muted:       #5c5c78;   /* placeholder, disabled */
  --color-text-link:        #818cf8;   /* inline links */
  --color-text-link-hover:  #a78bfa;

  /* Status / Semantic */
  --color-success:          #34d399;   /* accepted answer, verified */
  --color-warning:          #fbbf24;   /* bounties, warnings */
  --color-danger:           #f87171;   /* errors, downvotes */
  --color-info:             #60a5fa;   /* tags, info badges */

  /* Tag chips */
  --color-tag-bg:           #1e1e35;
  --color-tag-text:         #818cf8;
  --color-tag-border:       #3a3a5c;
  --color-tag-bg-hover:     #2a2a4a;

  /* Typography */
  --font-sans:   'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  --font-mono:   'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;

  /* Spacing */
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 20px;
  --space-6: 24px;
  --space-8: 32px;
  --space-10: 40px;
  --space-12: 48px;

  /* Radius */
  --radius-sm:  6px;
  --radius-md:  10px;
  --radius-lg:  16px;
  --radius-xl:  24px;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-sm:  0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  --shadow-md:  0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  --shadow-glow: 0 0 20px rgba(108,99,255,0.25);

  /* Transitions */
  --transition-fast: 0.15s ease;
  --transition-base: 0.25s ease;
}
```

Add this import to `index.css` so Inter loads from Google Fonts:
```css
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
```

Set the global base styles:
```css
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  background-color: var(--color-bg-base);
  color: var(--color-text-primary);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

a { color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { color: var(--color-text-link-hover); }

::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--color-bg-base); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-full); }
```

