## Component-by-Component Redesign

### 1. `Navbar.jsx` + `Navbar.css`

Remove all existing Navbar CSS. Rewrite completely.

**Appearance:**
- Background: `var(--color-bg-surface)` with a `1px solid var(--color-border)` bottom border. No top orange stripe.
- Left side: Querious logo image (import from root folder) followed by the brand name "Querious" in `var(--font-sans)` `600` weight, `18px`, color `var(--color-text-primary)`. The name sits to the right of the logo image.
- Center: Search bar (see below).
- Right side: notification bell (if logged in), avatar/username chip (if logged in), or "Log in" + "Sign up" buttons (if logged out).

**Search bar:**
- Width: `clamp(200px, 35vw, 480px)`.
- Background: `var(--color-bg-input)`.
- Border: `1px solid var(--color-border)`. On focus: `var(--color-border-focus)` with `var(--shadow-glow)`.
- Border-radius: `var(--radius-full)`.
- Left padding for search icon: `var(--space-10)`.
- Font size: `14px`, placeholder color `var(--color-text-muted)`.
- Search icon: use an inline SVG (magnifying glass, `16px`, `var(--color-text-muted)`).

**Log in / Sign up buttons (logged-out state):**
- "Log in": ghost button — transparent bg, `1px solid var(--color-border)`, `var(--color-text-primary)` text, `var(--radius-md)`, `8px 16px` padding. On hover: `var(--color-bg-elevated)`.
- "Sign up": filled button — `var(--color-brand-primary)` bg, white text, `var(--radius-md)`, `8px 16px` padding. On hover: darken 10% (use `filter: brightness(0.9)`). Subtle `var(--shadow-glow)`.

**Avatar chip (logged-in state):**
- A circle `36px × 36px` with `var(--color-brand-gradient)` background, white initial letter, `font-weight: 600`. No rectangular box — border-radius full.

**Notification bell:**
- Inline SVG bell icon, `22px`, `var(--color-text-secondary)`.
- Red badge: `8px × 8px` filled circle, `var(--color-danger)`, positioned top-right of the bell.
- On hover: icon color transitions to `var(--color-text-primary)`.

**Mobile Navbar (`≤ 640px`):**
- Search bar collapses to a magnifying glass icon button.
- Tapping the icon expands a full-width search bar below the navbar with a slide-down animation (`transform: translateY(-100%) → translateY(0)`, 200ms).
- Logo + brand name remain visible.
- "Log in" text becomes just an icon (person SVG).

**Hamburger button:**
- Only visible `≤ 640px`.
- Three horizontal lines SVG, `var(--color-text-secondary)`.
- On hover: `var(--color-bg-elevated)` background, `var(--radius-sm)`.

